WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.760
Separated from the Reineforce Junior,

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:38.230
Üso sneaks into the enemy fleet that's returning to the Zanscare homeland,

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:40.600
and makes it into the port.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.930
However, with no other way to escape safely,

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:48.560
Üso had no choice but use Queen Maria as a shield.

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.760
MARIA AND ÜSO

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.600
"Maria and Üso".

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:53.730
MARIA AND ÜSO

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:10.860
Üso dear, doing this won't help you! Stop it!

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.900
Please, hang on tight!

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:19.530
Stand aside! We have your queen!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:28.460
If we enter the space colony, we may be able to do something.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:29.630
Break through!

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:31.630
What's that suit doing?!

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.600
What? The crab one?!

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:37.300
Your methods are shameless, you white bastard!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.700
Are you trying to kill the queen?!

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:51.260
I can't let the Federation Forces use the queen in front of the Zanscare people!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.360
So, you don't care if she dies?!

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:57.460
If I can just move my body a little more!

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.500
If you lose your hostage, you may as well be naked!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.500
I can do this!

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:04.930
What?!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.500
This is Shahkti's mother!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.760
Üso, use the queen as a shield more!

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.100
Boosters! Üso, run!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.830
Miss Marbet!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.730
Release the queen!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.400
Not so fast!

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:31.730
Run!

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:34.830
You impudent... Let me go!

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.830
Üso, this is a battlefield.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.400
This is a place where some would even kill their own kin!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.630
If the main engine blows, it could obliterate the entire port!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.660
Pilot... Die!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.460
Miss Peggie!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.600
Üso, promise me!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.200
Promise you? What?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.560
Survive!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:06.660
No matter what, live your life for us!

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.700
Miss Peggie!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:20.160
Cronicle, don't kill this child!

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.860
Why would you be so lenient?!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.230
That pilot is an enemy who used you as a shield!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.400
He's also a friend of Shahkti's!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.060
He holds a great power for good!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.330
Okay, let's take the elevator into the space colony.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.230
Shouldn't we seal the port?

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.460
Use that one.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.500
Okay, now to enter the space colony...

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.060
It's the inside of the Zanscare space colony.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:06.760
Man, even if it is just simulated gravity, at least I can feel my body weight again.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.500
There are a lot of people here.

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:10.230
Seriously.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.930
What happened at the port? Let us through!

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.300
The elevator to the port will be running again soon.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.800
Don't push! You can go up the mountain to the port soon!

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.860
Was there a coup d'etat up there?

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.400
How'd you get in?!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.360
We've been spotted!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.560
Now what?!

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.460
Get out! It's dangerous in the port!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.030
What happened?

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.460
Are you okay! How violent!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.300
Let's go!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.030
It worked!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:39.930
Yeah.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.530
What?

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.000
You!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:43.760
What is it?

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:48.560
Be quiet. They're watching your movements.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:49.760
Follow me.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.000
Huh?

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:51.960
It's him.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.800
Oh, him!

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:08.600
Eat.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.360
If you lose your strength, it's all over.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.730
Miss Peggie was protecting me.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.630
It's a pilot's instinct to protect their comrades!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:24.560
Peggie knew she wasn't going to make it out of here alive.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.700
Miss Peggie... She told me to survive.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:32.160
Then eat! You have an obligation to!

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:52.630
Üso Ewin, get up!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.060
If there's anything you want to know, start with me!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.160
Run!

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:58.760
Stop it!!

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:04.500
Stop!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.330
He moves very well!

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:17.930
Your theory that Newtypes can be born on Earth seems to be correct, Your Excellency.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.730
We still don't know.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.860
If they're training children like this to be pilots,

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:28.630
then the rebels must have a serious pilot shortage.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:32.860
If they're mass producing mobile suits that even a child could pilot,

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:35.300
that could be a threat to us!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:41.030
That almost sounds like you're evading responsibility for this.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.060
Cronicle Asher, requesting your leave, sir.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.600
Where's the exit?

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.860
Lieutenant.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.630
Üso, you can't escape from here.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:13.530
Because of you, Miss Peggie...

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:23.030
You're nothing but a boy soldier,

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.460
used by the League Militaire to make up for their lack of manpower!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.400
Nice! Nice!

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.900
Take care of Karl.

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:39.100
I've got this!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:41.330
Princess, I've brought you some tea.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.630
C-Coming!

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:43.460
Hurry!

00:08:56.660 --> 00:09:00.560
I was right! As I thought, it's someone I know.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.200
Üso...

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.630
Please be okay.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.730
Princess!

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:29.960
Princess, please don't make trouble for me.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.400
Princess?

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:34.960
Take your time eating. I've got more, if you like.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.560
Thank you!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.100
So, how do you know him?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:40.030
He's a friend of our dads'.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.600
He runs the Sannoze factory here.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:47.530
I guess there are even people here in Zanscare that are sick of the guillotine.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:49.500
Of course!

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:52.360
They built this nation on the fear of the guillotine, after all.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.530
It's a big trailer, like the Camion!

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:01.330
It's the Victory! What's it doing here?!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:05.400
We service mobile suits captured by the military.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:07.560
Is that the machine you were talking about?

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.460
Why would they bring it to this factory?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.730
This factory is also under direct military control.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:16.130
They give us little jobs like this. Just wait here and be quiet.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.530
Y-Yes, sir.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.600
Since there's no damage to the cockpit, that means...

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.800
What's that limousine?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.100
They're big shots from BESPA!

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.660
Huh? Isn't that Üso?!

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.330
He's okay!

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:31.160
What are the chances?!

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.260
And isn't that lady Maria?!

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:36.260
Yeah! That's Maria Armonia!

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:40.430
What's Üso doing with the queen?!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:55.260
I heard that you and Shahkti were very close in Kasarelia.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.700
We were neighbors.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:11:00.160
She and I have been separated for too long.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.260
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.360
So, perhaps you...

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:08.660
I'm hoping you can convince her to become my heir.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:13.730
Shahkti hates Zanscare for using the guillotine, even on Earth.

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:17.760
As do I. I want to end its use.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.200
Then why not stop it from being used?

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:22.600
I need help to get that done.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:27.260
You want us to repair a complicated machine like this?

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.860
It looks like it can still work, though.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:29.900
We'll see.

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:33.960
We can end the guillotine's use when Shahkti succeeds me.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.260
Aren't you the queen?

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:44.600
Is it true you were able to pilot this without much training?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.960
I've learned a lot. Let me reward you.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.730
Take these.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.860
It's time.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.500
They're sweets. I suggest you eat them soon.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.400
We leave at once!

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:01.160
Yes, sir!

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:08.560
You will truthfully answer any questions the people here have...

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.830
...about repairing this machine, is that clear?

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:11.830
Yes, sir.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:16.560
No one is to be allowed in here except authorized personnel!

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:17.660
Sir! Sir!

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:50.400
He despises Zanscare's methods.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.000
He refused to listen to me.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:58.600
Then the boy will go to the guillotine at tomorrow's festival.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:03.100
You're having that boy publicly executed by guillotine?!

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:06.900
That's going to have the opposite effect! Please, sir, reconsider.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:11.360
I don't want to hear your opinion! It's an order from Fonse Kagatie!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:17.430
Then why not stop the guillotine from being used?

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.830
Piece of cake!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.630
Odelo, what are you doing here?!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.530
What about you and Zanscare's...

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.960
Go on, step down on my shoulders!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.160
Okay, then...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.130
Tomáš?!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:31.800
Thanks.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.130
Elisha?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.660
Eh? What's up?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:35.630
N-Nothing...

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.260
I told you guys to keep quiet!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.800
He came here with the queen!

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.900
But Üso's an important friend of ours!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:46.000
We couldn't just watch and do nothing!

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:50.800
You kids, I'd be able to hide. But I can't do anything for him!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:54.030
We'll manage something, now that we've got this machine!

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:56.200
I don't understand what you mean!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:00.930
BESPA told us to ask his advice in fixing this machine, but...

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.960
We won't cause you any trouble.

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:06.400
You just have to pretend you were injured, too.

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:07.400
What?

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:11.060
I'll give you a punch and then tie you up.

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.400
But...

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:13.460
Can I have one?

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.560
With this Victory...

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.530
There's something written on the paper.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.430
What?

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.330
I didn't see it under the candy powder.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.030
What is this?

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.960
Some kind of diagram.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.630
It looks like the central plaza.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.030
It's a diagram of tomorrow's festival!

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:33.960
And the diagram under it shows the weak points in the space colony's security!

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:37.060
The queen gave you this, right?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:37.900
Yeah.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:41.760
Do you have some kind of connection to the queen?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.360
Connection?

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.360
Hey, this part has "Shahkti" written on it!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.300
Huh?

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.100
See?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.160
Shahkti's coming to the plaza.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.730
Maybe I should go back tonight as their prisoner.

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:02.030
Sunsets on a space colony are a beautiful sight, too.

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:05.260
When you see the festival tomorrow,

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.700
and see the good your mother does,

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.160
On the journey tabi no yukue no
I think you'll understand.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.160
On the journey tabi no yukue no

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.300
My mother died.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.400
In the flickering darkness yurameku yami ni

