00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:39.030
Her Majesty will now give her blessing to the people!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.800
Blessing? What do you mean?

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:44.260
Her mercy. She shall spread her love for all!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.260
Oh Maria!

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:51.460
This person, Maria Armonia, is my mother...

