Suzy! It's me.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:30.960
Warren!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.360
It's just like Üso said. You were right near here, Shahkti.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.430
Warren!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.260
Let's go.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.600
Your Majesty!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.760
Lieutenant, bring the queen to her room.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.000
Is it always like this?

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:58.360
Yes. She exhausts her strength, for the sake of the people.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.400
My people, silence! Silence!

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:11.930
Maria Pure Armonia always stands here to give you her blessing!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:15.300
And so, pray for Maria's recovery...

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:19.500
...and that those who threaten the queen's heart go to the guillotine!

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:20.800
To the guillotine with the rebels!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:23.630
The guillotine for those who threaten Maria's heart!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.530
Let the path be purified with blood! Clear the path for Maria's recovery!

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:31.060
Why?!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:34.630
Why must I, too, be sent to the guillotine?!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.630
These people!

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:40.960
The Federation pilots who came to assassinate Queen Maria,

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.030
along with Captain Tassilo Wago, who led...

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:47.200
...the Keilas Guilie Fleet to defeat and failed to protect the capital!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:49.530
Are those crimes deserving of the guillotine?!

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:50.800
Quiet!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:52.230
Let me go!

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:56.930
Was Admiral Mutterma Sugan behind this, Your Excellency?!

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.900
The guillotine for the rebels!

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.100
Princess! Princess Shahkti!

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:13.760
What? Who's moving it?!

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.960
Isn't it just an exhibit? It's moving!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:18.030
What? Proceed with the guillotine ceremony!

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:21.000
Please move! Just doing my job here, folks.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.700
We just want to show everyone how cruel the guillotine is...

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:28.930
...and that our only enemies are these wannabe dictators!

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:30.600
Out of the way!

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.530
I'll just use my rifle, then!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.630
Üso!

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.100
Over here, Victory!

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:39.800
The enemy mobile suits are moving!

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.830
Citizens, please get out of the way!

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:42.960
Fire!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.160
What do I do?!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:52.660
Odelo!

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:55.160
It's all yours!

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.660
You were great, Odelo!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.400
Can't let you take all the glory!

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.360
Now do mine!

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.200
Üso, this is a battlefield.

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:07.430
This is a place where some would even kill their own kin!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.560
I'll survive, Miss Peggie!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:13.630
Hurry!

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.400
Gosh, you kids...

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:16.430
Go to it!

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.460
Are you nuts?!

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:31.430
Using a beam rifle in the middle of the plaza?!

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.860
Did they turn down the beam's power to avoid damaging the space colony?

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.700
I've been cornered!

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:52.130
This is your face. This is your face now, isn't it, Üso?

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:58.660
It's the distance of memories that allows you to treasure them!

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:01.730
And yet here you are, running around, alive and well!

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:32.330
Fighting with Katejina, who is now their enemy,

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:36.200
Üso makes it out with the help of Mr. Oliver and the others.

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:40.600
But war demands a great deal of blood.

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:44.130
Having to overcome the death of Miss Junko,

00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:48.230
Üso wails sadly as he uses the Big Cannon.

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:52.700
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:56.000
Next Episode A FLASH THAT RUNS THROUGH SPACE
"A Flash that Runs though Space".

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.330
Please watch it!
